      "file": "android-sim/app/src/main/cpp/CMakeLists.txt",
      "start": 52,
      "end": 56,
      "text": "add_subdirectory(\"${MUJOCO_SOURCE_DIR}\" mujoco-build EXCLUDE_FROM_ALL)\n# Bionic provides localtime_r; upstream 3.10 requires an explicit POSIX feature macro.\ntarget_compile_definitions(mujoco PRIVATE _POSIX_C_SOURCE=200809L)\n# Android packages .so files; keep the bundled library SONAME unversioned.\nset_target_properties(mujoco PROPERTIES VERSION \"\" SOVERSION \"\")"
